inal","quote":"中子竦，长水校尉〖6〗；少子建，步兵校尉〖7〗：闻恪诛，车载其母而走。峻遣骑督刘承，追斩竦于白都〖8〗。建得渡江，欲北走魏；行数十里，为追兵所逮〖9〗。恪外甥都乡侯张震及常侍朱恩等，皆夷三族〖10〗。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100},{"id":"zhanggu-q-11becf9ea8d07e78320a","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7bd0a42024ed4befa1c7","layer":"original","quote":"年六十七，赤乌七年卒。谥曰定侯。子震嗣","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"zhanggu-q-54be8c7c5420b54cf336","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-b7a9a76d5ddb42d82068","layer":"original","quote":"震，诸葛恪诛时，亦死","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":67,"end":77}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
